# UTC. commerce times from contracts/entrypoints.md §스케줄, which now names all six -- every
# commerce Dataset member gets a line, per S05 (playbook 02-test-discipline.md T10 records a real
# outage from a dataset with a collector and no cron line). No commerce line uses minute 0: the
# hourly ranking run starts there and takes ~74s, and two walks on one source at once would halve
# the 5s pace the daily walks are spaced to protect (each is ~7 min).
0 * * * *   cosmai collect commerce --dataset ranking
5 2 * * *   cosmai collect commerce --dataset product
30 3 * * *  cosmai collect commerce --dataset review_low --board suncare
15 4 * * *  cosmai collect commerce --dataset review
45 4 * * *  cosmai collect commerce --dataset review_stats
30 5 * * *  cosmai collect commerce --dataset new_product
# naver datalab: monthly (키워드 사전 기준, contracts/entrypoints.md), day 1. 06:10 clears every
# commerce time above (02:05/03:30/04:15/04:45/05:30) and avoids minute 0 like they do.
10 6 1 * *  cosmai collect naver --dataset datalab
